{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Many drew accounts of fulfilled [Eb]things
[Gm]Held by eyes [F]that saw from the [Eb]start
[Bb]I searched deep for truth and [Eb]proof
[Cm7]To write an orderly re[Fsus4]port [F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Most excellent Theophilus [Eb]hear
[Bb]Know the certainty of what you [Eb]learned
[Gm]From the start [F]to the finish [Eb]clear
The word is [Cm7]sure [F]and firmly [Bb]stirred
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
My first book told what He be[Eb]gan
[Gm]To do and [F]teach in the [Eb]land
[Bb]Then He gave instructions by the [Eb]Spirit
[Cm7]To chosen ones who [Fsus4]waited [F]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
